  "notes": "Field experiment, wheat (T. aestivum var Axe), 2 growing seasons (2010, 2011). 4 biochar treatments: A=0 (no char), B=35 kg/ha banded, C=175 kg/ha banded, D=5 t/ha surface spread. 3 P treatments: 0, 35, 70 kg DAP/ha (= 0, 8.8, 17.6 kg P/ha). n=3 replicates. No significant biochar effect on yield (P=0.268). Significant P fertilizer effect (P<0.001). Yield data only in Fig. 2 (t/ha). Average yield: 2.58 t/ha (2010), 1.98 t/ha (2011). No tabulated yield values. Figure-estimated values are approximate. Biochar appeared to suppress yield in unfertilized plots.",
